gin="04:33.312" end="04:33.901">hana</span><span begin="04:33.901" end="04:34.180">se</span><span begin="04:34.180" end="04:35.914">nayi</span><span begin="04:35.914" end="04:36.166"></span><span begin="04:36.166" end="04:38.137"></span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="05:11.933"><div begin="00:15.064" end="04:38.137"><p begin="00:15.064" end="00:18.929" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:15.064" end="00:15.678">君</span><span begin="00:15.678" end="00:15.926">に</span><span begin="00:15.926" end="00:16.193">出</span><span begin="00:16.193" end="00:17.644">会えて</span><span begin="00:17.644" end="00:17.926">よ</span><span begin="00:17.926" end="00:18.377">かっ</span><span begin="00:18.377" end="00:18.929">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真好啊能够与你邂逅，真好啊尽管也有辛酸</span></p><p begin="00:19.039" end="00:22.946" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:19.039" end="00:19.618">切</span><span begin="00:19.618" end="00:20.152">ない</span><span begin="00:20.152" end="00:21.656">けれど</span><span begin="00:21.656" end="00:21.941">よ</span><span begin="00:21.941" end="00:22.376">かっ</span><span begin="00:22.376" end="00:22.946">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真好啊 尽管也有辛酸</span></p><p begin="00:23.056" end="00:30.962" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:23.056" end="00:23.895">ひとり</span><span begin="00:23.895" end="00:24.162">の</span><span begin="00:24.162" end="00:24.914">夜</span><span begin="00:24.914" end="00:25.558">も</span><span begin="00:25.955" end="00:26.221">そ</span><span begin="00:26.221" end="00:27.125">ばに</span><span begin="00:27.125" end="00:28.162">いて</span><span begin="00:28.162" end="00:29.146">く</span><span begin="00:29.146" end="00:29.879">れ</span><span begin="00:29.879" end="00:30.962">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤单的夜里你依然伴我左右</span></p><p begin="00:30.972" end="00:34.994" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:30.972" end="00:31.414">世</span><span begin="00:31.414" end="00:31.916">界</span><span begin="00:31.916" end="00:32.198">に</span><span begin="00:32.198" end="00:32.855">たっ</span><span begin="00:33.164" end="00:33.665">た</span><span begin="00:33.665" end="00:33.932">ひ</span><span begin="00:33.932" end="00:34.398">と</span><span begin="00:34.398" end="00:34.649">り</span><span begin="00:34.649" end="00:34.994">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真好啊能够邂逅，这个世上独一无二的你</span></p><p begin="00:35.004" end="00:38.869" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:35.004" end="00:35.687">君</span><span begin="00:35.687" end="00:35.937">に</span><span begin="00:35.937" end="00:36.204">出</span><span begin="00:36.204" end="00:37.652">会えて</span><span begin="00:37.652" end="00:37.953">よ</span><span begin="00:37.953" end="00:38.385">かっ</span><span begin="00:38.385" end="00:38.869">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真好啊 能够邂逅</span></p><p begin="00:38.951" end="00:42.579" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:38.951" end="00:39.649">思</span><span begin="00:39.649" end="00:39.881">い</span><span begin="00:39.881" end="00:40.148">出</span><span begin="00:40.148" end="00:40.670">は</span> <span begin="00:41.164" end="00:41.615">夜</span><span begin="00:41.615" end="00:41.916">の</span><span begin="00:41.916" end="00:42.579">空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对你的思念，将化作点点繁星，在无边的夜空熠熠闪烁</span></p><p begin="00:43.015" end="00:48.032" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:43.015" end="00:43.596">星</span><span begin="00:43.596" end="00:44.196">にな</span><span begin="00:44.196" end="00:44.610">り</span> <span begin="00:45.148" end="00:45.898">輝</span><span begin="00:45.898" end="00:46.180">く</span><span begin="00:46.180" end="00:48.032">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在无边的夜空熠熠闪烁</span></p><p begin="00:48.340" end="00:50.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:48.340" end="00:48.689">ずっ</span><span begin="00:48.689" end="00:48.921">と</span><span begin="00:48.921" end="00:49.156">孤</span><span begin="00:49.156" end="00:49.639">独</span><span begin="00:49.639" end="00:49.889">だっ</span><span begin="00:49.889" end="00:50.211">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">长久孤独而破碎的心扉</span></p><p begin="00:50.221" end="00:52.274" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:50.221" end="00:50.673">壊</span><span begin="00:50.673" end="00:50.899">れ</span><span begin="00:50.899" end="00:51.007">た</span><span begin="00:51.007" end="00:51.448">心</span><span begin="00:51.448" end="00:51.674">の</span><span begin="00:51.674" end="00:51.900">ド</span><span begin="00:51.900" end="00:52.274">ア</span></p><p begin="00:52.284" end="00:53.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:52.284" end="00:52.678">夜</span><span begin="00:52.678" end="00:52.904">に</span><span begin="00:52.904" end="00:53.384">怯</span><span begin="00:53.384" end="00:53.638">え</span><span begin="00:53.638" end="00:53.811">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">畏惧黑夜的我，蜷缩在黑暗的房间</span></p><p begin="00:53.821" end="00:56.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:53.821" end="00:54.434">部屋</span><span begin="00:54.434" end="00:54.673">で</span><span begin="00:54.673" end="00:55.194">うずく</span><span begin="00:55.194" end="00:55.687">まっ</span><span begin="00:55.687" end="00:55.900">て</span><span begin="00:55.900" end="00:56.220">た</span></p><p begin="00:56.230" end="00:59.748" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:56.230" end="00:56.844">シーツ</span><span begin="00:56.844" end="00:56.997">に</span><span begin="00:56.997" end="00:57.392">顔</span><span begin="00:57.392" end="00:57.845">をあて</span><span begin="00:57.845" end="00:58.566">叫</span><span begin="00:58.566" end="00:58.886">ん</span><span begin="00:58.886" end="00:59.748">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蒙着被褥，嘶声呼喊，已无法汇成一个字眼</span></p><p begin="00:59.758" end="01:03.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:59.758" end="01:00.663">言葉</span><span begin="01:00.663" end="01:00.929">に</span><span begin="01:00.929" end="01:01.676">ならな</span><span begin="01:01.676" end="01:01.930">かっ</span><span begin="01:01.930" end="01:03.502">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已无法汇成一个字眼</span></p><p begin="01:03.512" end="01:07.764" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:03.512" end="01:04.176">迷</span><span begin="01:04.176" end="01:04.643">わず</span><span begin="01:04.643" end="01:05.111">何</span><span begin="01:05.111" end="01:05.629">もか</span><span begin="01:05.629" end="01:05.870">も</span><span begin="01:05.870" end="01:06.137">捨て</span><span begin="01:06.137" end="01:06.630">て</span><span begin="01:06.630" end="01:06.909">き</span><span begin="01:06.909" end="01:07.764">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你毫不犹豫地抛弃所有</span></p><p begin="01:07.774" end="01:11.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:07.774" end="01:08.653">こんな</span><span begin="01:08.653" end="01:09.400">私</span><span begin="01:09.400" end="01:09.641">を</span><span begin="01:09.641" end="01:09.835">愛</span><span begin="01:09.835" end="01:10.413">し</span><span begin="01:10.413" end="01:10.667">て</span><span begin="01:10.667" end="01:10.906">くれ</span><span begin="01:10.906" end="01:11.787">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱上了这样的我</span></p><p begin="01:11.797" end="01:15.701" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:11.797" end="01:12.418">いつも</span><span begin="01:12.418" end="01:13.117">君は</span><span begin="01:13.117" end="01:13.884">そばに</span><span begin="01:13.884" end="01:14.204">いて</span><span begin="01:14.204" end="01:14.912">くれ</span><span begin="01:14.912" end="01:15.701">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你始终陪伴在我左右</span></p><p begin="01:15.301" end="01:20.449" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:15.301" end="01:15.867">君</span><span begin="01:15.867" end="01:16.360">さえ</span> <span begin="01:16.360" end="01:16.867">いれ</span><span begin="01:16.867" end="01:17.213">ば</span> <span begin="01:17.294" end="01:17.866">それで</span><span begin="01:17.866" end="01:18.147">よ</span><span begin="01:18.147" end="01:19.105">かっ</span><span begin="01:19.105" end="01:20.449">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要有你　就已足够</span></p><p begin="01:19.036" end="01:22.901" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:19.036" end="01:19.650">君</span><span begin="01:19.650" end="01:19.898">に</span><span begin="01:19.898" end="01:20.165">出</span><span begin="01:20.165" end="01:21.616">会えて</span><span begin="01:21.616" end="01:21.898">よ</span><span begin="01:21.898" end="01:22.349">かっ</span><span begin="01:22.349" end="01:22.901">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真好啊能够与你邂逅，真好啊尽管也有辛酸</span></p><p begin="01:22.962" end="01:26.869" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:22.962" end="01:23.541">切</span><span begin="01:23.541" end="01:24.075">ない</span><span begin="01:24.075" end="01:25.579">けれど</span><span begin="01:25.579" end="01:25.864">よ</span><span begin="01:25.864" end="01:26.299">かっ</span><span begin="01:26.299" end="01:26.869">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真好啊 尽管也有辛酸</span></p><p begin="01:27.036" end="01:34.942" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:27.036" end="01:27.881">ひとり</span><span begin="01:27.881" end="01:28.201">の</span><span begin="01:28.201" end="01:28.880">夜</span><span begin="01:28.880" end="01:29.538">も</span><span begin="01:29.933" end="01:30.213">そ</span><span begin="01:30.213" end="01:31.147">ばに</span><span begin="01:31.147" end="01:32.148">いて</span><span begin="01:32.148" end="01:33.093">く</span><span begin="01:33.093" end="01:33.855">れ</span><span begin="01:33.855" end="01:34.942">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤单的夜里你依然伴我左右</span></p><p begin="01:34.943" end="01:38.965" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:34.943" end="01:35.385">世</span><span begin="01:35.385" end="01:35.887">界</span><span begin="01:35.887" end="01:36.169">に</span><span begin="01:36.169" end="01:36.826">たっ</span><span begin="01:37.135" end="01:37.636">た</span><span begin="01:37.636" end="01:37.903">ひ</span><span begin="01:37.903" end="01:38.369">と</span><span begin="01:38.369" end="01:38.620">り</span><span begin="01:38.620" end="01:38.965">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真好啊能够邂逅这个世上独一无二的你</span></p><p begin="01:38.917" end="01:42.782" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:38.917" end="01:39.653">君</span><span begin="01:39.653" end="01:39.907">に</span><span begin="01:39.907" end="01:40.174">出</span><span begin="01:40.174" end="01:41.654">会えて</span><span begin="01:41.654" end="01:41.921">よ</span><span begin="01:41.921" end="01:42.414">かっ</span><span begin="01:42.414" end="01:42.782">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个世上独一无二的你</span></p><p begin="01:42.940" end="01:46.568" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:42.940" end="01:43.638">思</span><span begin="01:43.638" end="01:43.870">い</span><span begin="01:43.870" end="01:44.137">出</span><span begin="01:44.137" end="01:44.659">は</span> <span begin="01:45.153" end="01:45.604">夜</span><span begin="01:45.604" end="01:45.905">の</span><span begin="01:45.905" end="01:46.568">空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对你的思念　将化作点点繁星在无边的夜空熠熠闪烁</span></p><p begin="01:46.924" end="01:51.941" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:46.924" end="01:47.505">星</span><span begin="01:47.505" end="01:48.105">にな</span><span begin="01:48.105" end="01:48.519">り</span> <span begin="01:49.057" end="01:49.807">輝</span><span begin="01:49.807" end="01:50.089">く</span><span begin="01:50.089" end="01:51.941">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在无边的夜空熠熠闪烁</span></p><p begin="01:52.239" end="01:54.251" ttm:agent="v3" itun