" end="03:04.669">誓</span><span begin="03:04.669" end="03:04.949">う</span><span begin="03:04.949" end="03:06.457">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与此承诺　我不再逃避</span></p><p begin="03:06.610" end="03:10.391" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="03:06.610" end="03:07.200">運</span><span begin="03:07.200" end="03:08.160">命の</span><span begin="03:08.160" end="03:08.894">時</span><span begin="03:08.894" end="03:10.391">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这宿命的时刻</span></p><p begin="03:09.410" end="03:14.420" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="03:09.410" end="03:10.411">心</span><span begin="03:10.411" end="03:10.662">が</span><span begin="03:10.662" end="03:10.891">生</span><span begin="03:10.891" end="03:11.396">き</span><span begin="03:11.396" end="03:11.851">てる</span><span begin="03:11.851" end="03:11.984">と</span><span begin="03:11.984" end="03:12.676">叫</span><span begin="03:12.676" end="03:12.917">ぶ</span><span begin="03:12.917" end="03:14.420">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心灵发出犹存的呐喊</span></p><p begin="03:14.450" end="03:18.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="03:14.450" end="03:15.146">君</span><span begin="03:15.146" end="03:16.626">がいなければ</span><span begin="03:16.626" end="03:16.906">何</span><span begin="03:16.906" end="03:17.172">の</span><span begin="03:17.172" end="03:17.853">価値も</span><span begin="03:17.853" end="03:18.452">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失去你　一切将毫无价值</span></p><p begin="03:18.482" end="03:21.459" ttm:agent="v3" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="03:18.482" end="03:19.362">ここに</span><span begin="03:19.362" end="03:20.002">生きる</span><span begin="03:20.002" end="03:20.149">意</span><span begin="03:20.149" end="03:20.642">味</span><span begin="03:20.642" end="03:20.896">も</span><span begin="03:20.896" end="03:21.200">な</span><span begin="03:21.200" end="03:21.459">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也没有了存在于此的意义</span></p><p begin="03:22.499" end="03:32.478" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="03:22.499" end="03:23.601">世界中</span><span begin="03:23.601" end="03:23.868">で</span><span begin="03:23.868" end="03:24.173">ひと</span><span begin="03:24.173" end="03:24.653">り</span><span begin="03:24.653" end="03:25.160">君</span><span begin="03:25.160" end="03:25.855">だけを</span><span begin="03:25.855" end="03:26.641">信</span><span begin="03:26.641" end="03:27.159">じ</span><span begin="03:27.159" end="03:27.639">て</span><span begin="03:27.639" end="03:32.478">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这世上　我只相信唯一的你</span></p><p begin="03:33.113" end="03:36.978" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="03:33.113" end="03:33.654">君</span><span begin="03:33.654" end="03:33.908">に</span><span begin="03:33.908" end="03:34.162">出</span><span begin="03:34.162" end="03:35.642">会えて</span><span begin="03:35.642" end="03:35.894">よ</span><span begin="03:35.894" end="03:36.348">かっ</span><span begin="03:36.348" end="03:36.978">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真好啊能够与你邂逅　，真好啊尽管也有辛酸</span></p><p begin="03:36.927" end="03:40.834" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="03:36.927" end="03:37.616">切</span><span begin="03:37.616" end="03:38.149">ない</span><span begin="03:38.149" end="03:39.655">けれど</span><span begin="03:39.655" end="03:39.896">よ</span><span begin="03:39.896" end="03:40.349">かっ</span><span begin="03:40.349" end="03:40.834">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真好啊 尽管也有辛酸</span></p><p begin="03:40.906" end="03:48.812" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="03:40.906" end="03:41.900">ひとり</span><span begin="03:41.900" end="03:42.179">の</span><span begin="03:42.179" end="03:42.898">夜</span><span begin="03:42.898" end="03:43.408">も</span><span begin="03:43.912" end="03:44.178">そ</span><span begin="03:44.178" end="03:45.138">ばに</span><span begin="03:45.138" end="03:46.126">いて</span><span begin="03:46.126" end="03:47.124">く</span><span begin="03:47.124" end="03:47.886">れ</span><span begin="03:47.886" end="03:48.812">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤单的夜里　你依然伴我左右</span></p><p begin="03:48.980" end="03:53.002" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="03:48.980" end="03:49.444">世</span><span begin="03:49.444" end="03:49.911">界</span><span begin="03:49.911" end="03:50.191">に</span><span begin="03:50.191" end="03:50.863">たっ</span><span begin="03:51.123" end="03:51.644">た</span><span begin="03:51.644" end="03:51.885">ひ</span><span begin="03:51.885" end="03:52.390">と</span><span begin="03:52.390" end="03:52.644">り</span><span begin="03:52.644" end="03:53.002">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真好啊能够邂逅，这个世上独一无二的你</span></p><p begin="03:52.896" end="03:56.761" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="03:52.896" end="03:53.680">君</span><span begin="03:53.680" end="03:53.934">に</span><span begin="03:53.934" end="03:54.188">出</span><span begin="03:54.188" end="03:55.641">会えて</span><span begin="03:55.641" end="03:55.907">よ</span><span begin="03:55.907" end="03:56.362">かっ</span><span begin="03:56.362" end="03:56.761">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个世上独一无二的你</span></p><p begin="03:56.885" end="04:00.513" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L54"><span begin="03:56.885" end="03:57.664">思</span><span begin="03:57.664" end="03:57.905">い</span><span begin="03:57.905" end="03:58.184">出</span><span begin="03:58.184" end="03:58.604">は</span> <span begin="03:59.172" end="03:59.624">夜</span><span begin="03:59.624" end="03:59.891">の</span><span begin="03:59.891" end="04:00.513">空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对你的思念　将化作点点繁星，在无边的夜空熠熠闪烁</span></p><p begin="04:00.932" end="04:05.949" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L55"><span begin="04:00.932" end="04:01.668">星</span><span begin="04:01.668" end="04:02.160">にな</span><span begin="04:02.160" end="04:02.527">り</span> <span begin="04:03.174" end="04:03.893">輝</span><span begin="04:03.893" end="04:04.159">く</span><span begin="04:04.159" end="04:05.949">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在无边的夜空熠熠闪烁</span></p><p begin="04:05.337" end="04:09.198" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L56"><span begin="04:05.337" end="04:06.139">あの日</span><span begin="04:06.139" end="04:07.634">君がくれた</span><span begin="04:07.634" end="04:08.381">夢の</span><span begin="04:08.381" end="04:09.198">欠片</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一天你留给我的　梦的碎片</span></p><p begin="04:09.208" end="04:13.180" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L57"><span begin="04:09.208" end="04:10.163">この手</span><span begin="04:10.163" end="04:11.628">握りしめて</span><span begin="04:11.628" end="04:12.403">離</span><span begin="04:12.403" end="04:12.655">さ</span><span begin="04:12.655" end="04:12.883">な</span><span begin="04:12.883" end="04:13.180">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会紧握在手中永不放开</span></p><p begin="04:13.190" end="04:17.113" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L58"><span begin="04:13.190" end="04:13.869">きっ</span><span begin="04:13.869" end="04:14.148">と</span><span begin="04:14.148" end="04:14.656">こん</span><span begin="04:14.656" end="04:15.162">なに</span><span begin="04:15.162" end="04:15.642">本</span><span begin="04:15.642" end="04:16.149">気に</span><span begin="04:16.149" end="04:16.883">なれた</span><span begin="04:16.883" end="04:17.113">愛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此认真而执著的爱</span></p><p begin="04:17.323" end="04:21.217" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L59"><span begin="04:17.323" end="04:18.124">二度と</span><span begin="04:18.124" end="04:20.138">な</span><span begin="04:20.138" end="04:21.217">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此生绝不会再有一次</span></p><p begin="04:21.227" end="04:25.219" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L60"><span begin="04:21.227" end="04:21.903">君</span><span begin="04:21.903" end="04:22.169">と</span><span begin="04:22.169" end="04:23.155">出会えて</span><span begin="04:23.155" end="04:23.876">世界</span><span begin="04:23.876" end="04:24.156">は</span><span begin="04:24.156" end="04:24.849">変わっ</span><span begin="04:24.849" end="04:25.219">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自从与你邂逅　我的世界已全然不同</span></p><p begin="04:25.229" end="04:29.180" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L61"><span begin="04:25.229" end="04:26.147">心</span><span begin="04:26.147" end="04:27.148">動かす</span><span begin="04:27.148" end="04:27.628">君</span><span begin="04:27.628" end="04:28.334">探</span><span begin="04:28.334" end="04:28.641">して</span><span begin="04:28.641" end="04:28.880">い</span><span begin="04:28.880" end="04:29.180">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追寻着让我心动的你</span></p><p begin="04:29.190" end="04:33.202" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L62"><span begin="04:29.190" end="04:30.403">あの日の</span><span begin="04:30.403" end="04:31.403">二人に</span><span begin="04:31.403" end="04:31.883">戻</span><span begin="04:31.883" end="04:32.150">れ</span><span begin="04:32.150" end="04:32.643">なく</span><span begin="04:32.643" end="04:32.909">て</span><span begin="04:32.909" end="04:33.202">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕再也无法回到当初的你我</span></p><p begin="04:33.312" end="04:38.137" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L63"><span begin="04:33.312" end="04:33.901">離</span><span begin="04:33.901" end="04:34.180">せ</span><span begin="04:34.180" end="04:35.914">な</span><span begin="04:35.914" end="04:36.166">い</span><span begin="04:36.166" end="04:38.137">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也不会离你而去</span></p></div></body></tt>